{"out": "ON1_the_wait", "end": "قدّيش استنّيتو، ومن أي بلد؟ خبّرونا بالتعليقات", "endsub": "How long did you wait, and in which country? Tell us in the comments", "lines": [{"who": "Wadad", "ar": "سعاد، اسمعي: قدّيش لازم يستنّى الواحد كلوة هون؟", "en": "Souad, listen: how long does someone wait for a kidney here?", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude-btbtp-media/dfdfe77e-d5be-5566-b0cd-41236d750b75/scratchpad/b/ai09_paper.png", "z": [1.05, 1.2, 0.5, 0.6], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude-btbtp-media/dfdfe77e-d5be-5566-b0cd-41236d750b75/scratchpad/b/ai09_l01.mp3"}, {"who": "Souad", "ar": "قدّيش؟", "en": "How long?", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude-btbtp-media/dfdfe77e-d5be-5566-b0cd-41236d750b75/scratchpad/b/ai09_paper.png", "z": [1.6, 1.7, 0.62, 0.48], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude-btbtp-media/dfdfe77e-d5be-5566-b0cd-41236d750b75/scratchpad/b/ai09_l02.mp3"}, {"who": "Wadad", "ar": "ما في رقم. ما حدا بينشرو.", "en": "There's no number. Nobody publishes it.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude-btbtp-media/dfdfe77e-d5be-5566-b0cd-41236d750b75/scratchpad/b/ai09_paper.png", "z": [1.6, 1.75, 0.4, 0.48], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude-btbtp-media/dfdfe77e-d5be-5566-b0cd-41236d750b75/scratchpad/b/ai09_l03.mp3"}, {"who": "Souad", "ar": "بأميركا بينشروا الأرقام لكل مستشفى. ونحنا؟ كل واحد بيسأل جارو.", "en": "In America they publish the numbers for every hospital. Here? Everyone asks their neighbour.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude-btbtp-media/dfdfe77e-d5be-5566-b0cd-41236d750b75/scratchpad/b/ai09_hourglass.png", "z": [1.05, 1.25, 0.5, 0.62], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude-btbtp-media/dfdfe77e-d5be-5566-b0cd-41236d750b75/scratchpad/b/ai09_l04.mp3"}, {"who": "Wadad", "ar": "وعمر؟ ضلّ سنين عالغسيل… لحتى إجا أمين.", "en": "And Omar? Years on dialysis… until Amine came along.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude-btbtp-media/dfdfe77e-d5be-5566-b0cd-41236d750b75/scratchpad/b/ai09_hourglass.png", "z": [1.6, 1.75, 0.36, 0.55], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude-btbtp-media/dfdfe77e-d5be-5566-b0cd-41236d750b75/scratchpad/b/ai09_l05.mp3"}, {"who": "New kidney", "ar": "وهيك وصلت أنا. بس مش كل حدا عندو أمين. لهيك منسأل.", "en": "That's how I got here. But not everyone has an Amine. That's why we're asking.", "img": "/home/claude/btbtp-media/scenes/e12_arrive.png", "z": [1.05, 1.2, 0.55, 0.58], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude-btbtp-media/dfdfe77e-d5be-5566-b0cd-41236d750b75/scratchpad/b/ai09_l06.mp3"}, {"who": "Souad", "ar": "يعني منستنّى… وما منعرف لإيمتى.", "en": "So we wait… and don't know until when.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude-btbtp-media/dfdfe77e-d5be-5566-b0cd-41236d750b75/scratchpad/b/ai09_hourglass.png", "z": [1.2, 1.4, 0.6, 0.58], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude-btbtp-media/dfdfe77e-d5be-5566-b0cd-41236d750b75/scratchpad/b/ai09_l07.mp3"}]}